      "details": "Actual independent content review by /root/lesson_content_review_2; report SHA256 cb8d6b0d43665af39b8757f456bc312c08152c5ac895d2e21e6047a015afeac4; original target infinitive_form_completion. Owner acceptance does not resolve this advisory.",
      "excerpt": "Fullfør «Maja bestemmer seg for ___ ___ i morgen» med et uttrykk om reisen.",
      "explanation": "The prompt permits a two-word expression about the journey. A completion such as a pakke is a natural infinitive about journey preparation and fits the supplied sentence, but the hidden criterion specifically requires the meaning to travel. That lexical restriction is absent from the visible task.",
