      "excerpt": "Bruk setningsmønstre fra leksjonen til å beskrive planen, gjengi opplysningen fra Jonas og si hva gjestene kan gjøre.",
      "explanation": "The visible task generally asks for sentence patterns from the lesson and a description of the plan, Jonas's information, and what guests can do. The hidden rubric specifically requires an a-infinitive for Nora's plan. A coherent reply using Nora lager middag klokka 19, a content clause for Jonas, and a modal for the guests can satisfy the visible instructions while failing that unstated requirement.",
